{"title":"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2,_by_DARSHSHETTY4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2, by DARSHSHETTY4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Complex_number\" title=\"Complex number\">complex number</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/1/a41c472a4c13229bc8c624716cbfdb996af9d6af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9+bi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Positive\">positive</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Real_number\" title=\"Real number\">real number</a> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/5/555ad558a9227e54bbf0c1131c9ea47067c9a4e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^{2}=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" />.  Given that the imaginary parts of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/c/6cc465fd1aa32bb3b899cf7819576e9bf6d8822f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^{2}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/4/c24715cf154264417c2f17ff54b41ebdefe63d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^{3}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> are the same, what is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> equal to?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Squaring, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/b/89b124699c7e8abded65759ab8247afbbc1b7697.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(9 + bi)^2 = 81 + 18bi - b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"200\" height=\"19\" />. Cubing and ignoring the real parts of the result, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/f/1af48d8bc3c0705bee53a7124947599488869f57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(81 + 18bi - b^2)(9 + bi) = \\ldots + (9\\cdot 18 + 81)bi - b^3i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"403\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Setting these two equal, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/f/e9fb72cd8584c19fdd1d9ea6dfd476ebc087cee3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18bi = 243bi - b^3i$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"141\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/7/4e708119b795bb9542b2267121518d501d23562e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(b^2 - 225) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"119\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/2/9a2363794f99997a282b64f1251b8fe5384bd113.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = -15, 0, 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"16\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/f/0ff39ba262fdf0fc8425b3548976378ba294afba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, the solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/6/c76ef142bfaaa5a50249c625ffdcd74b8a897c90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{015}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2.2C_by_DARSHSHETTY4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2,_by_DARSHSHETTY4\">Solution 2, by DARSHSHETTY4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2, by DARSHSHETTY4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can solve this problem using the polar form of 9+bi. The magnitude is given by r = √(81 + b^2), cos(theta) = 9/r, and sin(theta) = b/r. I will use r because it will be easier to state on screen.\n</p><p>Now, by DeMoivre's, we have z^2 = r^2(cos(2*theta) + isin(2*theta)). Since we only care about the imaginary part, we only need to expand the imaginary part.\nBy double-angle formula, sin(2*theta) = 2cos(theta)sin(theta). So, we have that the imaginary part of z^2 is r^2 * 2 * 9/r * b/r = 18b.\n</p><p>Now, by DeMoivre's we have z^3 = r^3(cos(3*theta) + isin(2*theta)). sin(3*theta) = 3sin(theta) - 4sin^3(theta). Hence, we have the imaginary part as z^3 as r^3 * (3 * b/r - 4 * (b/r)^3) = 3br^2 - 4b. \n</p><p>Finally, setting 18b = 3b(√(81 + b^2)^2) - 4b^3, we get:\n</p><p>18b = 243b + 3b^3 - 4b^3, or b^3 = 225b, or b = +- 15 or 0. \n</p><p>However, the problem specifies that b is a positive real number, so b can only be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/6/c76ef142bfaaa5a50249c625ffdcd74b8a897c90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{015}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I\" title=\"2007 AIME I\">2007 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2007\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2007 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017205749\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 162/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1786/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 108/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2690/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   15.563      1 -total\n 49.46%    7.697      1 Template:AIME_box\n 49.11%    7.643      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4760:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017205749 and revision id 291310. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}